// Cyclomatic counting rules (base 1, +1 each): IfStatement, ForStatement,
// ForInStatement, ForOfStatement, WhileStatement, DoWhileStatement,
// CatchClause, SwitchCase (including `default`), ConditionalExpression, and
// LogicalExpression (`&&`, `||`).
